return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-10T08:37:21+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-10T08:37:21+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Àwọn ìfitónilétí àṣẹ lórí SMS àti WhatsApp fún ilé-ìtajà yín, tí a fi ránṣẹ́ nípasẹ̀ Zinn® Campaigns lábẹ́ orúkọ ilé-ìtajà yín gan-an. So pọ̀ pẹ̀lú ìtẹ̀mọ́lẹ̀ kan ṣoṣo; kò sí àwọn kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ láti lẹ̀ mọ́ ọn.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Awọn imudojuiwọn aṣẹ','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Ilé-ìtajà rẹ ti sopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'A ti ge asopọ ile itaja rẹ. Ko si ifiranṣẹ kankan ti yoo ranṣẹ.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Ìsopọ̀ yẹn gba àkókò púpọ̀ tàbí a bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀ nínú àwárí kiri mìíràn. Tẹ Sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® kò gba ìsopọ̀ náà. Tẹ "Sopọ̀" lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá tún kùnà, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Aaye rẹ ko le de ọdọ Zinn®. Ṣayẹwo pe olupese rẹ ngbanilaaye awọn asopọ ti njade, lẹhinna tẹ «Tun sopọ mọ».','Help'=>'Ìrànlọ́wọ́','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Fi àwọn imudojuiwọn SMS ati WhatsApp ranṣẹ si awọn alabara rẹ nipa awọn aṣẹ wọn, labẹ orukọ ile-itaja tirẹ, ti a sanwo lati inu kirẹditi Zinn® rẹ.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Sopọ yoo ṣi Zinn® ninu ferese yii. Wọle tabi ṣẹda akọọlẹ kan, fọwọsi ile itaja yii, iwọ yoo si pada taara si ibi. O ko nilo lati lẹ kọkọrọ rara.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Sopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn a ko le de ọdọ Zinn® ni akoko yii. A o tun gbiyanju laipẹ.','Store'=>'Ilé-ìtajà','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Ṣi silẹ fun akọọlẹ rẹ','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Kò tíì ṣí sílẹ̀ fún àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ. Zinn® yóò fi imeeli ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nígbà tí ó bá ṣí.','Disconnect'=>'Ge asopọ kuro','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'A kò gba ọ́ láàyè láti so ilé-ìtajà yìí pọ̀.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'A kò fún ọ láàyè láti ge ìsopọ̀ ilé-ìtajà yìí.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Fi awọn imudojuiwọn aṣẹ ranṣẹ si mi nipasẹ SMS si nọmba foonu mi. Awọn owo ifiranṣẹ ati data le waye. Fesi STOP lati da duro.','Connection'=>'Ìsopọ̀','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'A kò fún yín láàyè láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'A dupẹ. O le beere fun iranlọwọ ni bayi ki o si fi awọn iroyin ranṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'A ti yọ ifọwọsi kuro. A kì yóò fi ohunkóhun ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn® títí tí ẹ ó fi gbà lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'Zinn® AI kò le dáhùn ní báyìí. Fi ìbéèrè rẹ ránṣẹ́ sí ẹgbẹ́ tó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí; ẹnìkan yóò fèsì.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Inú mi dùn pé ìyẹn yanjú rẹ̀.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Nọ́mbà ìwé-ìbéèrè rẹ ni %s; ẹgbẹ́ wa yóò fèsì síbí àti nípasẹ̀ e-mail.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Fọwọsi kókó ọ̀rọ̀ náà, iṣẹ́ náà àti, níwọ̀n ìgbà tí ilé-ìtajà rẹ kò tíì sopọ̀, àdírẹ́sì e-mail rẹ.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® kò gba tikẹti naa. Ṣayẹwo awọn aaye ki o tun gbiyanju; ti o ba tẹsiwaju lati kuna, fi imeeli ranṣẹ si support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìbéèrè láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Jọ̀wọ́ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Reply sent.'=>'A ti fi èsì ránṣẹ́.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì yẹn ti wà ní títì. Ẹ fi tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì tuntun ránṣẹ́ dípò rẹ̀.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'A ko le fi esi rẹ ranṣẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Ń duro de iranlọwọ Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Ń reti rẹ','Answered'=>'Ti dahùn','Closed'=>'Ti pado','Report a bug'=>'Fi àbùkù tó wà lẹ́jọ́','Send feedback'=>'Fi èsì ránṣẹ́','Request a feature'=>'Beere fun ẹya kan','Ask for help'=>'Béèrè fún ìrànlọ́wọ́','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Àwọn àtẹ̀jáde: WordPress, PHP, afikun yìí, WooCommerce (àti bóyá ó ń lo HPOS) àti àwọn afikun tí a tì lẹ́yìn tí a ṣàwárí','Your active theme and its version'=>'Akori ti n ṣiṣẹ lọwọlọwọ rẹ ati ẹya rẹ','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àfikún tí a fi sípò, àwọn àtẹ̀jáde wọn àti bóyá ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan wọn ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Ìsopọ̀: àdírẹ́sì ilé-ìtajà rẹ, bóyá ó ti sopọ̀, id ìfisílẹ̀ yìí àti bóyá Zinn® dáhùn sí àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ tó kẹ́yìn (kìí ṣe àmì ilé-ìtajà náà rárá)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Àwọn Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n Àṣẹ Zinn®: Ìrànwọ́','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Yọ ifohunsi mi kuro lati fi awọn ibeere iranlọwọ ranṣẹ','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd ni ó ń dáhùn ìrànwọ́ níhìn-ín. Kí ohunkóhun tó kúrò lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ, èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a ń fi ránṣẹ́, àti ibi tí a ń fi ránṣẹ́ sí:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Ibeere ti o tẹ: a firanṣẹ si Zinn® AI ni api.zinndigital.com, eyiti o dahun lati awọn nkan iranlọwọ Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tikẹti ti ẹ fi ranṣẹ: koko-ọrọ rẹ, ifiranṣẹ yin, ede alakoso yin ati adirẹsi imeeli idahun, ti a fi ranṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Awọn iwadii aisan: awọn bulọọki ti o samisi nikan, ọkọọkan han ni kikun ṣaaju ki o to firanṣẹ. Kii ṣe ami-ẹri ile-itaja, awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle tabi awọn alaye ti awọn alabara rẹ.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Awọn tiketi rẹ: nigba ti ile itaja rẹ ba wa ni asopọ, oju-iboju yii n ka awọn tiketi rẹ ati awọn idahun ẹgbẹ lati Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'A máa ń gba àkọsílẹ̀ ẹni tí ó fohùnsọ̀kan àti ìgbà tí ó ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀ sílẹ̀. Ẹ lè fà á sẹ́yìn nígbàkúgbà lórí ojú-ìbòjú yìí.','Agree and continue'=>'Gba wọle ki o tẹsiwaju','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Béèrè lọ́wọ́ Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Kí ni o nílò ìrànwọ́ pẹ̀lú rẹ̀?','Ask'=>'Bèèrè','Help articles'=>'Àwọn àtìkò ìrànlọ́wọ́','That solved it'=>'Èyí yanjú ẹ̀','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Ṣe o tun nilo iranlọwọ bi? Fi ranṣẹ si ẹgbẹ ti o wa ni isalẹ.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'Firanṣẹ si ẹgbẹ Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Kí ni?','Subject'=>'Kókó','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Kí ló ṣẹlẹ̀? Fún àṣìṣe kan, àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ tó fi hàn.','Reply e-mail'=>'Imeeli idahun','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìkọ nǹkan sí i láti lo ímeèlì ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ Zinn® tó so ṣọ́ọ̀bù yìí pọ̀.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Ile-itaja rẹ ko ni asopọ, nitorinaa ẹgbẹ naa n dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Awọn iwadii (aṣayan). Samisi bulọọki kan lati so mọ; eyi gangan ni ohun ti a firanṣẹ.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'Firanṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Àwọn tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì mi','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'So ile-itaja re pọ lati tẹle awọn tikẹti re nibi. Titi di igba naa, ẹgbẹ naa yoo dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'A ko le gbe àwọn tikẹẹti rẹ wọle ní báyìí. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','No tickets yet.'=>'Kò sí àkọsílẹ̀ kankan títí di báyìí.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® dahun ni %s:','Your reply'=>'Èsì rẹ','Send reply'=>'Firanṣẹ esi','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® SMS and WhatsApp sign-up'=>'Iforukọsilẹ SMS ati WhatsApp ti Zinn®','Lets visitors sign up for offers and news by SMS or WhatsApp. Unticked by default; marketing only.'=>'Ó ń gba àwọn àlejò láyè láti forúkọ sílẹ̀ fún àwọn ìfilọ́ àti ìròyìn nípasẹ̀ SMS tàbí WhatsApp. A kò yan án ní àkọ́kọ́; fún títà ọjà nìkan.','Sign-up settings'=>'Àwọn ètò ìforúkọsílẹ̀','Channel'=>'Ikanni','SMS'=>'SMS','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Visitor chooses SMS or WhatsApp'=>'Alejo yan SMS tabi WhatsApp','Zinn® SMS offers consent'=>'Ìfọwọ́sí àwọn ìfilọ SMS Zinn®','Zinn® WhatsApp offers consent'=>'Ìfọwọ́sí àwọn ìfilọ́lẹ̀ Zinn® lórí WhatsApp','Records a marketing opt-in in Zinn® Campaigns for the phone number in this form.'=>'Ó ń gba iforukọsilẹ tita sinu Zinn® Campaigns fun nọmba foonu to wa ninu fọọmu yii.','Send me offers and news on WhatsApp to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Fi awọn ipese ati awọn iroyin ranṣẹ si mi lori WhatsApp si nọmba yii. Kii ṣe dandan; yọwọ kuro nigbakugba.','Send me offers and news by SMS to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time by replying STOP. Message and data rates may apply.'=>'Fi àwọn ìfilọ́ àti ìròyìn ránṣẹ́ sí mi nípasẹ̀ SMS sí nọ́mbà yìí. Kò pọn dandan; yọwọ́ kúrò nígbàkigbà nípa fífèsì pẹ̀lú STOP. Owó iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ àti dátà lè wáyé.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns to show this sign-up form.'=>'So ile-itaja yii pọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns lati ṣafihan fọọmu iforukọsilẹ yii.','Mobile number'=>'Nọ́mbà fóònù àgbélékè','How should we send them?'=>'Báwo ni a ṣe gbọ́dọ̀ fi wọ́n ránṣẹ́?','Send me offers and news by the channel I chose above. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Fi àwọn ìfilọ́ àti ìròyìn ránṣẹ́ sí mi nípasẹ̀ ìkànnì tí mo yàn lókè yìí. Àṣàyàn; o lè yọwọ́ kúrò nígbàkúgbà.','Leave this empty'=>'Fi èyí sílẹ̀ ní òfo','Sign up'=>'Forúkọ sílẹ̀','Thank you, you are signed up. You can unsubscribe any time.'=>'O ṣeun, o ti forukọsilẹ. O le yọwọ kuro nigbakugba.','Please enter your mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ nọ́mbà fóònù rẹ pẹ̀lú kóòdù orílẹ̀-èdè rẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ +44 7700 900123.','Please tick the box to agree.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ sàmì sí àpótí náà láti gbà.','This form was open for a long time. Please reload the page and send it again.'=>'Fọọmu yii ti wa ni sisi fun igba pipẹ. Jọwọ tun oju-iwe naa gbe jade ki o tun fi ranṣẹ.','Too many sign-ups from here. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ pọ̀ jù láti ibí yìí. Jọ̀wọ́ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','We could not save your sign-up. Please check your number and try again.'=>'A ko le fi iforukọsilẹ rẹ pamọ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo nọmba rẹ ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà olùlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pamọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé web tí ó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ayelujara ti o ti fẹsẹmulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkànnì ati gbigbe awọn ọna asopọ si, pẹlu idaduro owo naa ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun tí wọ́n fi ń gbọ́ bùkátà','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́-àdáni àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn òǹkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àwòrán, àwọn olùgbéejáde àti àwọn akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ akanṣe kan síbẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ àtẹ̀jáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣe àmúdájú Zinn® kò pèsè àjápọ̀ ìgbasílẹ̀ fún àmúdájú yìí. Rí i dájú pé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè ráàyè sí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùnà nínú àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.','Order updates'=>'Awọn imudojuiwọn aṣẹ','Opted in (yes or no)'=>'Kópa nínú rẹ̀ (bẹ́ẹ̀ni tàbí bẹ́ẹ̀kọ́)','Channel (SMS or WhatsApp)'=>'Ìkanni (SMS tàbí WhatsApp)','WhatsApp link'=>'Ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ WhatsApp','Message us on WhatsApp'=>'Fi ifiranṣẹ ranṣẹ si wa lori WhatsApp','Zinn® WhatsApp button'=>'Bọtini WhatsApp Zinn®','A button that opens a WhatsApp chat with your store. It shows only once your WhatsApp number is connected in Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Bọtini kan ti o ṣí ifọrọwerọ WhatsApp pẹlu ile-itaja rẹ. Yoo han nikan lẹhin ti a ba ti sopọ nọmba WhatsApp rẹ ni Zinn® Campaigns.','Button settings'=>'Àwọn ètò bọ́tìnì','Button text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ bọ́tìnnì','Show to'=>'Fihàn fun','Everyone'=>'Gbogbo eniyan','Shoppers not yet getting order updates'=>'Awọn olura ko tii gba awọn imudojuiwọn aṣẹ','Connect your WhatsApp number in Zinn® Campaigns to show this button. Until then it shows nothing on your site.'=>'So nọmba WhatsApp rẹ pọ ninu Zinn® Campaigns lati fi bọtini yii han. Titi di igba naa kò ni fi ohunkohun han lori aaye ayelujara rẹ.']];